<title>USA: Quaker Chemical chairman to retire.</title>
<headline>Quaker Chemical chairman to retire.</headline>
<dateline>CONSHOHOCKEN, Pa. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quaker Chemical Corp said on Wednesday Peter Benoliel will retire as chairman at the company's annual meeting of shareholders on May 7, 1997.</p>
<p>Ronald Naples, president and chief executive officer of the company for the past 18 months, will succeed Benoliel as chairman and retain his current positions, the company said.</p>
<p>Benoliel will remain on the board of directors, and will serve as chairman of the executive committee, Quaker Chemical said.</p>
</text>
